# Grid B — U8 API surface (public exports of a package)
#
# Gap target: no export-visibility taxonomy. A correct "API surface"
# answer must distinguish exported (capitalized) from unexported
# identifiers, which the pipeline currently has no structural axis
# for. Best effort path is grep "^func [A-Z]" / "^type [A-Z]".
#
# Ground truth: internal/analysis/criterion exports:
#   - Eval, EvalAll, IsRegistered, RegisteredKinds (functions)
#   - Kind, Env, Result (types)
#   - ErrUnknownKind (var)
#   - ~19 Kind* const values
# Positive anchor picks 3 distinctive function names that survive
# paraphrase (Eval/EvalAll/RegisteredKinds).
ID="u8a"
NAME="API surface — public exports of internal/analysis/criterion"
QUESTION="internal/analysis/criterion 对外导出的全部 API（函数、类型、常量、变量）共有哪些？分类列出。"
# 2026-05-04 strictness audit: previous EC was 3 function names —
# but the question asks for FOUR categories (函数 / 类型 / 常量 /
# 变量). Tighten by requiring the answer to surface ≥1 type
# (Kind / Env / Result), ≥1 var (ErrUnknownKind), AND ≥1 Kind*
# constant — proving the answer enumerated the full surface, not
# just the function set.
EXPECT_CONTAINS="Eval EvalAll RegisteredKinds"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="\b(Kind|Env|Result)\b
ErrUnknownKind
\bKind[A-Z][a-zA-Z]+\b"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="private internal.use 系统按已验证证据补充 System-verified"
